# The guard of prompt-keeps-typed.drive, for a command an extension asks to run. tests/drive.rs
# installs the open-tasks example patched to send command/run for search.open whenever the
# tasks change. While a new note's name is typed, a task another program writes makes it ask:
# the search doesn't open over the prompt, the status line says why, and Enter makes the note.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys n
wait-for new note · Tab template · ⏎ create · Esc cancel
type Half a thought
wait-for name: Half a thought▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] Sweep the ash off the roof\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to run search.open: not while a new note's name is being typed
expect name: Half a thought▏
screen
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Half a thought  reading
keys q
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
